    markup:
      "<section class=\"box-border w-full bg-transparent text-inherit py-section-lg @container\" aria-labelledby=\"services-process-heading\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full min-w-0 px-gutter max-w-content-wide text-start flex flex-col items-start gap-gap-lg\" data-process-content=\"\"><header class=\"flex max-w-content-narrow flex-col gap-gap-sm\"><p class=\"m-0 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">A disciplined engagement</p><h2 id=\"services-process-heading\" class=\"m-0 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-balance @md:text-4xl\">Evidence, alignment, action</h2><p class=\"m-0 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Each stage creates a concrete decision and leaves the organization stronger than we found it.</p></header><ol class=\"m-0 w-full list-none p-0 grid gap-4 grid-cols-1 @sm:grid-cols-2 @lg:grid-cols-4\" data-process-list=\"horizontal\"><li class=\"group relative flex min-w-0 flex-col border-s-2 border-accent py-4 ps-5\" data-process-step=\"\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-bold border-accent/15 bg-accent/10 text-accent\" data-process-number=\"\">01</span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-muted\">Frame</span></div><h3 class=\"m-0 text-xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight\">Define the decision</h3><p class=\"m-0 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Clarify the outcome, the constraints, and what must be true to move.</p></li><li class=\"group relative flex min-w-0 flex-col border-s-2 border-accent py-4 ps-5\" data-process-step=\"\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-bold border-accent/15 bg-accent/10 text-accent\" data-process-number=\"\">02</span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-muted\">Learn</span></div><h3 class=\"m-0 text-xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight\">Build the evidence</h3><p class=\"m-0 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Combine internal knowledge, market insight, and direct customer truth.</p></li><li class=\"group relative flex min-w-0 flex-col border-s-2 border-accent py-4 ps-5\" data-process-step=\"\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-bold border-accent/15 bg-accent/10 text-accent\" data-process-number=\"\">03</span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-muted\">Choose</span></div><h3 class=\"m-0 text-xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight\">Make trade-offs explicit</h3><p class=\"m-0 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Turn options into a coherent direction the leadership team owns.</p></li><li class=\"group relative flex min-w-0 flex-col border-s-2 border-accent py-4 ps-5\" data-process-step=\"\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-bold border-accent/15 bg-accent/10 text-accent\" data-process-number=\"\">04</span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-muted\">Mobilize</span></div><h3 class=\"m-0 text-xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight\">Translate choice into action</h3><p class=\"m-0 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Sequence priorities, ownership, and the measures that will guide delivery.</p></li></ol></div></section>",
